{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e52da249d09547d2","type":"text","text":"Last session Solaris Verdict gathered information from the forbidden library, encountered and questioned a Devil known as Dis and began to ready themselves for a journey to Armount. So we pick up the night before the journey in Lights Respite where Timora Fayerine and Elly prepare for a dinner with Aralia and Azest.\n\nREMEMBER BEFORE THEY LEAVE MAKE ACHILLES TELL STU ABOUT ARGDIN\n\n\nWhile in the air it’s a 2 day flight to Yormindar\n\nRoll a d6 in the morning to determine encounter\n\n\t1. Encounter with a Roc\n\t2. Wind storm that could reck the ship\n\t3. Sunny clear day\n\t4. Thunder storm creating magical disturbance in the air\n\t5. A Blue dragon can be seen in the skies above Armount\n\t6. Sunny clear day\n\nLanding in Yormindar.\n\nUpon arrival Azest will tell them that she is going to land the sky ship at open break nearby. \n\nWhile in Yormindar the party will kinda be able to do whatever they wish and Ill make it up on the fly.\n\nIts another 2 day travel to the spot where they can no longer use the sky ship then a 5 day hike up the mountain to Storm crest village.\n\n\nNight 1 in the snowy mountain range:\n\nStu\n\n\"You're vision wakes into a void of lightening raining down then a flash hits you and suddenly your standing on a frozen lake, with a waterfall covered in lightening in front of you and from deep within you soul you hear the voice of a woman \"Find the tomb know our history now your birth right\". \"\n\nNight 3 in the snowy mountain range:\n\nCassian Draemont\n\nI need everyone to leave the room.\n\n\"Your eyes open in a dark torch lit room with your father standing in front of you, \"Cassian we need to look for the artifact before he comes, if he finds us in here we are doomed to die. We need to find the change bringers staff remember the tome. At the bottom of Armount we will find a gate to a realm beyond. If we find the relic of the change bringer the master will bring fortune on us and it could lead us to the true goal the Relic of the one trapped in\" And the vision fades there\".\n\nNight 5 in the snowy Mountains: \n\nSaggnus WildBottom \n\n\"You awaken in a blaze of excruciating heat and see the familiar figure of Zariel holding a chain that is wrapped around your fathers neck. \"Knowing where you come from changes nothing. You are a servant and a slave, but you have been a bad dog and disobeying me so I command you. Collect an ancient tome within the Dunamis ward and give it to me, when you are nearing to the pain will guide the way. Remember this is you last chance disobey me again and you will suffer a fate far worse than death.\" Before you awake see a mirror and within it a red skinned man with horns, then you wake up with the symbol of a burning hand burned into your right shoulder \"\n\nWhile hiking each day roll a d8:\n\n\t1. A White Dragon can be spotted very close over head flying east.\n\t2. An avalanche hits and the party has to make skill checks to avoid falling down the cliff of a mountain top.\n\t3. Harsh snowy weather conditions rise and they lose a days travel.\n\t4. A nice snowy but clear day.\n\t5. A pack of Yetis can be seen blocking the parties pack (roll d12 for amount).\n\t6. An Ice storm begins and makes for rocky weather, they must make con saves beating a 15 or suffering 1 point of exhaustion.\n\t7. Can only happen once, the party sees the ghost of a woman crying that approaches Stu touching him on his chest showing him a vision of his mother fleeing Storm crest.\n\t8. A peaceful day.\n\nAs the party approach the village walls they will see many goliath warriors patrolling the grounds.\n\n\nOne named Argdin will be on the look at for Stu and an ally of Achilles he will have the letter from his mother and tell them basic information of what the state of the village is\n","x":-1080,"y":-880,"width":920,"height":1720},
		{"id":"a140ca06466fa307","type":"text","text":"Their departure: \n\nWhen the party wishes to depart on their journey they will be wished good look and gazed upon by the people of the city they swore to save and the nation it resides in.\n\n\nFloating in the skies above the city of Volstar from the top of the mountain peak beside the Hellos academy and below the Castle of Volstar, Azest Thyless begins to channel energy in the palms of her hands and you watch a familiar relic appear the Dreamers Heart and with it you watch her open a familiar door which shatters leaving behind a volatile shacking fracture in space the dreamers heart then shoots a beem of purple energy into it and you watch the fracture crack and split the fabric of the universe around you opening into a space that leads into her dimension and approaching is a gigantic ship with three large purple clothed sails, a wooden frame lined in metal and four huge rocks on each corner of the ship glowing a bright blue keeping the ship aloft. Engraved on the side \"Veridian\". Following it a gigantic plat form hundreds of feet tall with multiple ports for a sky ship to dock at attaches to the mountain side she then says \"Approach Solaris journey awaits. That was fucking cringe it sounded better in my head\"\n\nAs you are drifting from the port that rests at the top of the Sky View District into the bright morning sun below you are the people of the city chanting your name Solaris Verdict and the call of their people Ardens Solaris And as the sky ship begins to pick up speed you all know that there will forever be a home for you to return to in Volstar.\n","x":-160,"y":-880,"width":798,"height":618},
